### Variables: inject a permanent Supabase JWT locally; never commit tokens.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@token = {{$dotenv CLOUDBREAK_JWT}}
@anonymousToken = {{$dotenv CLOUDBREAK_ANONYMOUS_JWT}}

### Enregistrer le token (nominal) — 204
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/push-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]" }

### Format invalide — 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/push-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "nope" }

### Compte anonyme — 403 ACCOUNT_REQUIRED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/push-token
Authorization: Bearer {{anonymousToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]" }

### Sans Authorization — 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/push-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "push_token": "ExponentPushToken[xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx]" }

### Désinscrire le token — 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/push-token
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
